Dependency the toolkit, such as using maven or gradle
Add Trace Toolkit apm-toolkit-trace provides the APIs to enhance the trace context, such as createLocalSpan, createExitSpan, createEntrySpan, log, tag, prepareForAsync and asyncFinish. Add the toolkit dependency to your project.
&lt;dependency&gt; &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.skywalking&lt;/groupId&gt; &lt;artifactId&gt;apm-toolkit-trace&lt;/artifactId&gt; &lt;version&gt;${skywalking.version}&lt;/version&gt; &lt;/dependency&gt;

